From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:28:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-84: the design surface's information bar, like WPF
 (0.84.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

WPF (WPF and Silverlight Designer Overview > Information Bar): "The Information
bar appears at the top of Design view and displays information about
rendering problems". The page's JS errors went to the output panel only; now a
bar at the top of the design surface says how many and the first one (file:
line); 看全部 lists every one in the output panel (showErrors), × hides it until
another error comes. Its clicks are the overlay's own (both modes): the page
never sees them and nothing is selected. Recorded in WPF_DIFF_LOG.md (and the
0.83.0 rows got their commit).

Tests (all 4 layers pass: lib 159, smoke 169, panels, real VS Code 149): probe
(an error raised -> the bar shows it with test.js:7; 看全部 posts showErrors; ×
hides it; no select; the test's own error is not counted as a page error).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
